* ============================================================
* SKY130 Two-Stage CMOS Operational Amplifier
* Reference Netlist for Model-Based Constrained Sizing
*
* Fixed topology:
*   M1/M2 : NMOS differential pair
*   M3/M4 : PMOS current-mirror active load
*   M5    : NMOS tail current source
*   M6    : NMOS second-stage bias current source
*   M7    : PMOS second-stage common-source gain device
*
* Process : SKY130
* Corner  : TT
* VDD     : 1.8 V
* ============================================================

* SIZING CONTRACT FOR THIS CIRCUIT (not universal agent rules)
* Only scalar values of the 12 parameters in OPTIMIZABLE PARAMETERS may change.
* W_IN, W_LOAD, W_STAGE2, WBN0: 1..100 um (SPICE W/L values use um here).
* L_IN, L_LOAD, L_STAGE2, L_BIAS_N: 0.15..2 um.
* IBIAS: 1u..100u A. CC: 0.1p..10p F.
* N_TAIL and N_STAGE2_BIAS: integers 1..20, independently chosen.
* EFFECTIVE W of EVERY MOS, including N*WBN0, must remain 1..100 um.
* These are screening bounds, not proof every W/L combination has a PDK bin.
* Model lookup errors are failed simulations; never bypass them or edit models.
* M1/M2 identical W and L; M3/M4 identical W and L (fixed 1:1).
* MBIAS_N is diode-connected. MBIAS_N/M5/M6 share L and gate bias.
* M5 width=N_TAIL*WBN0; M6 width=N_STAGE2_BIAS*WBN0.
* Preserve all expressions and connections. No added/removed devices or fingers.
* Fixed: VDD=1.8 V, VCM=0.9 V, CLOAD=2p F, temperature=27 C, TT corner.
* DC acceptance applies to all 8 MOS in THIS amplifier: |Id|>=1n A,
* VGS(NMOS)/VSG(PMOS)-|Vth|>=0; VDS(NMOS)/VSD(PMOS)-|VDSAT|>=0;
* VDS/VSD must be positive. Use printed model diagnostics, not square-law guesses.
* M6: VGS=VBIAS_N, VDS=OUT. M7: VSG=VDD-N2, VSD=VDD-OUT.
* Raising N2 weakens M7. Both M6/M7 current balance and headroom matter.
* Width changes can change model bins and Vth, so mirror scaling is not exact.
* DC repair: at most 5 decisions cumulatively, within 10 total decisions.
* Check DC after EVERY decision. Run AC only for a passing DC candidate.
* Required performance: gain>=60 dB, UGB>=10 MHz, PM>=60 deg, power<=500u W.
* Gain=20log10|OUT/(VINP-VINN)| at 1 Hz; loop L=-OUT/(VINP-VINN).
* Require real(L)>0 at 1 Hz. UGB: first falling 0 dB crossing.
* PM=180+continuous_phase(L)*180/pi at UGB, unity feedback to VINP only.
* Power=-I(VSUPPLY)*V(vdd), including the single NMOS reference branch.
* Missing/nonfinite diagnostics or simulator errors cannot establish success.
* target.json encodes these bounds/acceptance checks for deterministic validation.
* If that file conflicts with this contract, stop and report the conflict.

.lib "/home/xu/eda/sky130-sim/libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice" tt

.temp 27


* ============================================================
* Fixed simulation conditions
* ============================================================

.param VDD=1.8
.param VCM=0.9
.param CLOAD=2p


* ============================================================
* OPTIMIZABLE PARAMETERS
*
* Matching is enforced structurally by shared parameters.
*
* M1 = M2
* L_M3 = L_M4; W_M4 = W_M3
*
* The sizing agent must modify these parameters only.
* ============================================================

* Differential input pair: M1 = M2
.param W_IN=10
.param L_IN=0.5

* PMOS current mirror: L_M3 = L_M4 = L_LOAD; W_M4 = W_M3 = W_LOAD
.param W_LOAD=10
.param L_LOAD=0.5

* NMOS bias reference / current mirrors: MBIAS_N, M5, M6
* M5 and M6 share L_BIAS_N with MBIAS_N.
* Their widths are independent positive-integer multiples of WBN0.
.param WBN0=10
.param L_BIAS_N=1.0

* Second-stage PMOS common-source gain device: M7
.param W_STAGE2=30
.param L_STAGE2=0.5

* Reference bias current
.param IBIAS=20u

* Miller compensation
.param CC=1p

* HARD STRUCTURAL MATCHING: ratios must be positive integers.
* M1/M2: identical W_IN and L_IN.
* M3/M4: shared L_LOAD and W_LOAD, M3 diode-connected.
* MBIAS_N/M5/M6: shared L_BIAS_N.
* W5=N_TAIL*WBN0 and W6=N_STAGE2_BIAS*WBN0.
* N_TAIL and N_STAGE2_BIAS must be positive integers, but may differ.
* Python rejects fractional N and effective device widths outside target bounds.
.param N_TAIL=1
.param N_STAGE2_BIAS=1


* ============================================================
* Supply
* ============================================================

VSUPPLY vdd 0 {VDD}


* ============================================================
* Differential AC input
*
* Common-mode = 0.9 V
* Differential AC amplitude = 1 V
* ============================================================

VINP vinp 0 DC {VCM} AC 0.5
VINN vinn 0 DC {VCM} AC -0.5


* ============================================================
* NMOS bias generation
* ============================================================

IBIAS_N vdd vbias_n {IBIAS}

XMBIAS_N vbias_n vbias_n 0 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8
+ W={WBN0} L={L_BIAS_N}


* ============================================================
* First Stage
* ============================================================

* Matched NMOS differential pair

XM1 n1 vinp ntail 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8
+ W={W_IN} L={L_IN}

XM2 n2 vinn ntail 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8
+ W={W_IN} L={L_IN}


* Matched PMOS current mirror active load

XM3 n1 n1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8
+ W={W_LOAD} L={L_LOAD}

XM4 n2 n1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8
+ W={W_LOAD} L={L_LOAD}


* Tail current source

XM5 ntail vbias_n 0 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8
+ W={N_TAIL*WBN0} L={L_BIAS_N}


* ============================================================
* Second Stage
* ============================================================

* NMOS bias current source.
* Gate shares vbias_n with M5 and MBIAS_N.
* L6 = L5 = L_MBIAS_N = L_BIAS_N.
* W6 is an independent positive-integer multiple of WBN0.

XM6 out vbias_n 0 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8
+ W={N_STAGE2_BIAS*WBN0} L={L_BIAS_N}


* PMOS common-source gain device.
* Gate is driven by the first-stage output n2.

XM7 out n2 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8
+ W={W_STAGE2} L={L_STAGE2}


* ============================================================
* Frequency Compensation
* ============================================================

CCOMP n2 out {CC}


* ============================================================
* Output Load
* ============================================================

CLOAD_OUT out 0 {CLOAD}


* DC-first testbench. Runner removes the marked AC block for DC-only checks.
* M7 is PMOS common-source; output still inverts VINP-VINN.
* A_diff = V(out)/(V(vinp)-V(vinn)); unity negative-feedback loop gain = -A_diff.
* PM is an open-loop unity-feedback estimate with feedback applied to VINP.
.control
set noaskquit
set numdgt=10
op
echo DC_OPERATING_POINT
print v(vdd) v(vinp) v(vinn) v(vbias_n)
print v(ntail) v(n1) v(n2) v(out) i(VSUPPLY)
let supply_current_a = -i(VSUPPLY)
let power_w = -i(VSUPPLY)*v(vdd)
print supply_current_a power_w
echo DEVICE_xm1
print @m.xm1.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[id]
print @m.xm1.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gm]
print @m.xm1.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gds]
print @m.xm1.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vgs]
print @m.xm1.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vds]
print @m.xm1.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vth]
print @m.xm1.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vdsat]
echo DEVICE_xm2
print @m.xm2.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[id]
print @m.xm2.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gm]
print @m.xm2.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gds]
print @m.xm2.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vgs]
print @m.xm2.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vds]
print @m.xm2.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vth]
print @m.xm2.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vdsat]
echo DEVICE_xm3
print @m.xm3.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[id]
print @m.xm3.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[gm]
print @m.xm3.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[gds]
print @m.xm3.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vgs]
print @m.xm3.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vds]
print @m.xm3.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vth]
print @m.xm3.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vdsat]
echo DEVICE_xm4
print @m.xm4.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[id]
print @m.xm4.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[gm]
print @m.xm4.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[gds]
print @m.xm4.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vgs]
print @m.xm4.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vds]
print @m.xm4.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vth]
print @m.xm4.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vdsat]
echo DEVICE_xm5
print @m.xm5.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[id]
print @m.xm5.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gm]
print @m.xm5.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gds]
print @m.xm5.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vgs]
print @m.xm5.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vds]
print @m.xm5.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vth]
print @m.xm5.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vdsat]
echo DEVICE_xm6
print @m.xm6.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[id]
print @m.xm6.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gm]
print @m.xm6.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gds]
print @m.xm6.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vgs]
print @m.xm6.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vds]
print @m.xm6.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vth]
print @m.xm6.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vdsat]
echo DEVICE_xm7
print @m.xm7.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[id]
print @m.xm7.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[gm]
print @m.xm7.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[gds]
print @m.xm7.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vgs]
print @m.xm7.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vds]
print @m.xm7.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vth]
print @m.xm7.msky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8[vdsat]
echo DEVICE_xmbias_n
print @m.xmbias_n.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[id]
print @m.xmbias_n.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gm]
print @m.xmbias_n.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[gds]
print @m.xmbias_n.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vgs]
print @m.xmbias_n.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vds]
print @m.xmbias_n.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vth]
print @m.xmbias_n.msky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8[vdsat]
echo END_DC_OPERATING_POINT
* BEGIN_AC_ANALYSIS
ac dec 100 1 1G
let differential_input = v(vinp)-v(vinn)
let differential_gain = v(out)/differential_input
let loop_gain = -differential_gain
let gain = db(differential_gain)
let loop_phase_deg = 180/PI*cph(loop_gain)
let loop_real = real(loop_gain)
meas ac loop_real_lf FIND loop_real AT=1
meas ac dc_gain_db FIND gain AT=1
meas ac ugb_hz WHEN gain=0 FALL=1
meas ac phase_at_ugb FIND loop_phase_deg WHEN gain=0 FALL=1
let phase_margin_deg = 180+phase_at_ugb
print phase_margin_deg
* END_AC_ANALYSIS
quit
.endc
.end
